\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Secure design review at each decision — Our testers review architectural decision records as they are written, not the finished system.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",\"Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",\"Monitoring and retest — Detections written for the system we built, and a retest cadence after launch. The loop does not stop at release.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$L96\",\"$undefined\"]}],\"$L97\"]}]]}]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"dg\",\"id\":\"engagement-shape\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-gantt\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 1000 252\",\"preserveAspectRatio\":\"xMidYMid meet\",\"role\":\"img\",\"aria-label\":\"Engagement shape for ERP: 6 phases. Phase 1, Process discovery, Weeks 1–6, inside the engagement window, producing the process documentation as implemented, including exception handling. Phase 2, Model and prototype, Weeks 5–10, inside the engagement window. Phase 3, Build, Weeks 9–30, inside the engagement window. Phase 4, Migrate, Weeks 20–34, inside the engagement window.