ment the exceptions, which is where the real requirements live.\"}]]}]]}]\na5:[\"$\",\"article\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"02 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Model and prototype\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 5–10\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Data model, chart of accounts, and a working prototype of the hardest process — not the easiest — loaded with real anonymised data.\"}]]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"article\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"03 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Build\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 9–30\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Module by module, finance first because everything reconciles to it. Each module goes live with a parallel run before the old one is retired.\"}]]}]]}]\na7:[\"$\",\"article\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"04 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Migrate\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 20–34\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Three migration rehearsals minimum. Reconciliation reports per rehearsal, signed off by finance each time.\"}]]}]]}]\na8:[\"$\",\"article\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"05 / 06\"}],[\"